Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.75,0:00:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,试想想不再有罪案…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine an end to crime…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.94,0:00:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再有贫穷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…an end to poverty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.67,0:00:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,试想有两百万份 令人满意的工作等着你去做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine 2 million good jobs waiting to be filled.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.49,0:00:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,听来像做梦吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like a dream, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.82,0:00:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候梦境会成真{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, sometimes dreams come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.66,0:00:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,三角洲城{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delta City.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.76,0:01:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了我们的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For our children.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.39,0:01:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是新闻追击 给我们三分钟 我们就给你全世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Media Break. You give us three minutes, we'll give you the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.10,0:01:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 我是凯西·黄 今晚的主要新闻有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, I'm Casey Wong. Our top story tonight:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.30,0:01:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,数月来的猜测告终 汽车之城变得日本化了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Motor City goes Japanese as the Omni Consumer Products Corporation…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.52,0:01:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天普及消费者产品公司宣布…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…ended months of speculation today by announcing its takeover…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.20,0:01:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,该公司会被跨国的金光公司收购{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…by the multinational Kanemitsu Corporation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.80,0:01:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖 你快点把微积分做完 要睡觉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, honey, hurry up with your calculus. It's almost time for bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.80,0:01:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在看新闻追击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm watching Media Break.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.99,0:01:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是第一间私有公司完全拥有和管理 一个大城市的私人机构{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the first private corporation to completely own and operate a major city.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.84,0:01:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,发言人表示对市区…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Company spokesmen express special interest…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.38,0:01:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新安置问题 有特别兴趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the issues of urban resettlement…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.65,0:01:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有底特律的罪案猖獗 市民都叫这做战区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and a crime wave in Detroit that many citizens are calling a war zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.32,0:01:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但OCP通常都有解决办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as usual, OCP has an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.26,0:01:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是建改警队 市区重建改造警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet the Rehabs, Urban rehabilitation officers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.16,0:02:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,从炮火连天的亚马逊战场来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the blazing fields of the Amazon War…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.50,0:02:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,新型市区维持治安警队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…comes state-of-the-art urban pacification.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.07,0:02:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是来协助市民 增强警方和对付黑道份子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here to help the people, augment the police force and deal with the gang problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.11,0:02:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有报导说 你们其实是来驱逐居民…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about reports you're actually evicting people…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.81,0:02:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,以便兴建三角洲城的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to make way for construction of Delta City?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.81,0:02:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮歌 听妈妈的话 来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nikko, you heard your mom. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.28,0:02:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.62,0:02:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 无家可归的人又怎样 - 真滑头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And the homeless? - What a gyp.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.52,0:02:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,要拆毁一些建筑物 才能兴建三角洲城{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some buildings have to come down before Delta can go up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.56,0:02:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不否认我们发了一两张驱逐令…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't deny we're serving an eviction notice or two…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.63,0:02:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但大部分人都接受过 验尿和入职考试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but most of these people have already taken their urine tests and placement exams.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.63,0:02:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,有新工作等着他们做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've got new jobs waiting for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.54,0:02:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是在过渡时期协助他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just helping them make the transition, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.87,0:02:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们是警察 别无其他 - 别无其他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're cops, nothing more. - Nothing more?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.14,0:02:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 我们不是机械人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're not robots, if that's what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.41,0:03:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.18,0:03:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该睡了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're supposed to be asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.32,0:03:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,电视说的是不是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true what the Tv said?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.79,0:03:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面是不是有个战区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That it's a war zone outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.89,0:03:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,别听电视说的 这里是你的家 知道吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't listen to what the Tv says. This is your home, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.29,0:03:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里很安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're safe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.34,0:03:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,付多少钱我也愿意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll buy that for a dollar!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.27,0:03:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out, get out, get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.38,0:03:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,（驱逐令）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.45,0:04:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一区是普及消费者产品公司的资产{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This neighborhood is the property of omni Consumer Products.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.09,0:04:07.68,Note,0,0,0,0,,（底特律 卡迪拉克区）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.72,0:04:27.89,Title,0,0,0,0,,《机械战警3》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.75,0:04:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 帮帮我们 - 我们正是来帮你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For God's sake, help us! - That's what we're here for, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.49,0:04:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get on the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.16,0:04:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 他们带我们去哪里 发生什么事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they taking us, Dad? What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.80,0:04:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别相信他们 他们会丢我们到街上 自生自灭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't believe them! They'll throw us into the streets to die like rats!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.77,0:04:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳粹党混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nazi sons of bitches!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.41,0:05:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,有需要时就射死她 但把她带走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot her if you must, but get her out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.81,0:05:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.08,0:05:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.68,0:05:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为进展得不错 是不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's going rather well, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.62,0:05:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.22,0:05:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫你快点 走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, I said, move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.19,0:05:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你对老妇粗暴点 好吗 - 闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Manandle an old lady, would you? - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.16,0:05:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走 - 上车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Move, move! - Get up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.26,0:05:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫你起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.23,0:05:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在下面干嘛 笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing down there? Piece of slime!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.67,0:05:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到我说吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.54,0:05:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫你起来 笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, get up, you drunken cow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.31,0:05:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后 那架起重机会爆炸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back! The crane's gonna blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.76,0:05:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家听着 这些巴士那儿也去不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me, people! These buses are going nowhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.57,0:06:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下来 为你们的家园抗争 根本不会有好日子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here! Fight for your homes! There is no silver lining!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.44,0:06:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是那些机构混蛋想中饱私囊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only corporate scumbags who want to line their pockets!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.25,0:06:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮歌 …{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nikko! Nikko!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.58,0:06:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom! Mom! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.86,0:06:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮歌 不 那是我的孩子 妮歌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nikko! No! That's my baby! Nikko, Nikko!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.33,0:06:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom! Dad! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.33,0:06:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.61,0:06:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.42,0:06:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.17,0:06:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.19,0:06:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.74,0:07:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 别走开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You! Stay where you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.53,0:07:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复 建改警队是来协助你们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeat: The rehabilitation officers are here to assist you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.11,0:07:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 你现在跟我们一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, it's okay. You're with us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.68,0:07:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走了没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.68,0:07:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是否安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.59,0:07:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.72,0:08:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.54,0:08:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 莫连奴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Moreno.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.70,0:08:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,掩着耳朵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover your ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.37,0:08:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rock 'r roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.35,0:08:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人 我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All clear. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.74,0:08:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.41,0:08:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- ED209 - 他不在侦察照片里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ED 209! - He wasrt in the recon photo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.88,0:09:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 你们擅自闯进警方范围{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze! You are trespassing on police property.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.72,0:09:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please surrender your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.52,0:09:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么事 - 她疯的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell? - Is she crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.52,0:09:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有二十秒时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have 20 seconds to comply.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.59,0:09:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 孩子 回来 - 你会害死我们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, kid, come back here! - You're gonna get us all killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.39,0:09:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她到底在干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.56,0:09:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们直接违反了法例第114条 第3节{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are in direct violation of penal code 114, section 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.83,0:09:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有权使用武力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am authorized to use physical force.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.34,0:09:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们现在有十秒时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You now have 10 seconds to comply.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.37,0:09:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不会相信的 他会像头小狗般忠心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't believe this. He'll be loyal as a puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.15,0:09:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有五秒 四秒…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have five seconds. Four seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.82,0:09:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,三秒 你们有一秒时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three seconds. You have one second to comply.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.25,0:09:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在有权…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am now authorized to…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.66,0:09:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,像头小狗般忠心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…be loyal as a puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.63,0:09:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,厉害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.44,0:09:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有效吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.71,0:09:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,从一个死了的警察偷来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stole it off a dead cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.31,0:10:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,（有人闯入）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.11,0:10:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 是警方军火库{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit! That's the police armory!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.45,0:10:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们取消了通行识认 - 我们快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They deleted the access signature. - Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.22,0:10:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们几分钟后才到达 我们想办法打开这扇门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be a few minutes. Let's figure out how to open that door!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.69,0:10:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开玩笑吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.24,0:11:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一站式购物呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One-stop shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.58,0:11:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走 要立刻离开 - 走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go! Gotta get out of here! - He's right. Let's ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.19,0:11:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你干嘛 选窗帘布 - 来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you, picking out drapes? - Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.59,0:11:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拿那个 - 为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get that. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.40,0:11:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,它看来很昂贵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.84,0:11:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.81,0:11:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop your weapons now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.58,0:11:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 放下武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it! Drop them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.72,0:11:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 你们擅自闯进警方范围{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze! You're trespassing on police property.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.36,0:11:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋 去死吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat lead, suckers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.61,0:12:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮歌 快上车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nikko, get in! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.85,0:12:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么可效劳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.00,0:12:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody move!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.11,0:12:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,把收银机里的钱拿来 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything in the register! Now! Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.46,0:13:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,当火箭科学家是什么滋味{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it like being a rocket scientist?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.21,0:13:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有单位注意 警方范围里发生破门闯入事件 请回应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All units, we have a B and E involving police property, please respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.27,0:13:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复 所有单位注意…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeat, all units, we have a…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.81,0:13:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐诺利 轮到你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Donnelly, it's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.88,0:13:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不行 我们上次去了 - 不 轮到路易斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No way. We went last time. - No, it's Lewis' turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,路易斯 到你去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lewis, you're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.39,0:13:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,路易斯…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lewis! Lewis! Lewis!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.16,0:13:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,究竟有没有人要拘捕我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't anybody gonna arrest me, or what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.53,0:13:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你朋友墨菲去了哪里 - 他不喜欢吃甜甜圈的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's your friend Murphy? - He's not big on doughnuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.76,0:13:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他不喜欢吃甜甜圈 - 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's not big on doughnuts. - I knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.23,0:13:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有单位注意 重复 是一辆残旧的黄色小型货车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All units, repeat, that is a battered yellow van.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.10,0:13:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有牌照 追踪器显示朝南面走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No plates. Tracking shows southbound…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.37,0:13:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是辆残旧的黄色小型货车 - 不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's a battered yellow van. - No shit, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.69,0:14:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫连奴 我们有伴了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moreno, company's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.56,0:14:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓稳点 来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.67,0:14:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,单位477正在追踪 朝东面艾普西道走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unit 477 in pursuit, eastbound, Esposito.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.75,0:14:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.12,0:14:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm watching it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.41,0:14:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.26,0:15:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还追着我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're still on our tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.22,0:15:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't sweat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.09,0:15:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 看这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kid. Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.40,0:16:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,别高兴得太早{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold the champagne.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.68,0:16:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你停在马路中心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stopped in the middle of the street!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.85,0:16:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是绿灯 - 笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That was my light! - You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.65,0:16:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大家没事吧 - 没事 你说笑吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is everybody okay? - Okay? What are you, a comedian?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.89,0:16:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用一辆全新SUX换的 看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I traded in a brand new SUX for this classic. Now look at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.43,0:16:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是垃圾 去废车场好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's garbage. It's going to the junkyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.23,0:16:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么 给婆娘一个徽章 她就以为自己是老板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this, fellas? You give a broad a badge and she gets delusions of gander.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.43,0:16:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是权势 笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's "grandeur, " dumbshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.74,0:16:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个新人令我紧张{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This new guy is making me nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.34,0:16:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信这不是人类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think this is exactly a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.78,0:16:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it's him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.35,0:16:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,单位477叫调遣部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unit 477 to dispatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.29,0:16:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,477叫调遣部 请通话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is 477 to dispatch. Come in, dispatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.69,0:16:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要支援{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could use some backup out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.76,0:17:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,调遣部 请通话 这是477{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, dispatch. Come in. This is 477 to dispatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.50,0:17:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,路易斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lewis.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.44,0:17:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,霹雳党{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Splatterpunks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.31,0:17:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 你们拿着机关枪干嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second, what do you need the shotgun for?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.71,0:17:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都要死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, we're all gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.85,0:17:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别动 支援快到了 - 别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sit tight, people. Backup's coming. - Sit tight?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.72,0:17:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是你 我也不会在这里 笨婆娘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it wasrt for you, I wouldn't even be here, you dumb broad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.42,0:17:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你作个协议 你想吃掉领带就继续闹吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make you a deal, tough guy. You want to eat the tie, keep it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.79,0:17:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松点 我哥哥是个警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy. My brother's a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.97,0:18:17.76,Note,0,0,0,0,,（距离113.7码）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.76,0:18:18.11,Note,0,0,0,0,,（声音分析）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.11,0:18:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,477叫调遣部 紧急事故 我们子弹不足 需要支援{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}477 to dispatch, code 3! We're low on ammo and need immediate backup!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.84,0:18:23.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（备份请求）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.15,0:18:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.89,0:18:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞德警官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sergeant Reed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.72,0:18:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在位置图上看到墨菲的巡逻车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got Murphy's cruiser on the grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.86,0:18:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他刚调头了 - 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He just turned around. - He what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.75,0:19:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨菲 我是瑞德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murphy, this is Reed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.89,0:19:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我派了三辆车去声援路易斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have three other vehicles en route to Lewis.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.42,0:19:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨菲 继续追踪 这是个直接命令 明白吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murphy, continue pursuit! That is a direct order! Do I make myself clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.66,0:19:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨菲 你是否听…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murphy, are you listen…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.57,0:20:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察 不准游荡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police officer. No loitering.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.72,0:20:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要支援{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You called for backup?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.46,0:20:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你来 墨菲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for dropping by, Murphy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.63,0:20:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们走了没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.13,0:20:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我扫描到还有三个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still scanning three.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.41,0:21:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下两个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make that two.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.75,0:21:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,快躲避 大攻击来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Block it! Megazone invasion!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.32,0:21:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静点 笨蛋 霹雳围是我们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pop a tranq, hypo-head. Splatterville's ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.36,0:21:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,射他的嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot him in the mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.46,0:21:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,半机械人要吃子弹了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cyborg eats bullets, Jock.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.06,0:21:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚他不吃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not tonight he don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.78,0:22:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,射他的嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit him in the mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.35,0:22:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 - 做吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up! - Do it! Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.39,0:22:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 做吧 - 闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do it! Do it! - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.29,0:22:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,试得好 变态鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice try, creeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.23,0:22:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.66,0:22:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有权保持缄默{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have the right to remain silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.44,0:22:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.08,0:22:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 墨菲 你没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, Murphy, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.15,0:22:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好 安妮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine, Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.19,0:22:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢关心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.66,0:23:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.77,0:23:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go! Everything will be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.08,0:23:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,放手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your damn hands off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.79,0:23:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,笨孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.76,0:23:40.19,Note,0,0,0,0,,（录影中）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.40,0:23:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 过来 - 你别管那个孩子好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come here. Come on. - Would you forget the stupid kid already?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.74,0:23:55.11,Note,0,0,0,0,,（录影中）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.65,0:24:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,[日语] 无能的美国人{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.69,0:24:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,[日语] 你们又肥又懒惰{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.79,0:24:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,[日语] 现在不单是钱财上受到威胁{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.06,0:24:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,[日语] 你越犯大错…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.13,0:24:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,[日语] 我们的竞争对手就越笑得大声{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.11,0:24:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,[日语] 你们的行动令我们双方蒙羞{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.64,0:24:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,金光先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kanemitsu-san…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.71,0:24:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我们遭受挫折{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I realize we've had setbacks…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.51,0:24:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们已经尽一切努力 让三角洲城如期复工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but we've done everything possible to get Delta City back on schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.45,0:24:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,[日语] 你们的能力都表露无遗了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.56,0:24:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,[日语] 我会派一个特工来修正你们的错误{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.23,0:24:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.67,0:24:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,本公司正面临…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you are now looking at a company…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.77,0:24:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,过渡时期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in transition.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.14,0:25:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用说 这样做已导致执行上某些…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Needless to say, this has resulted in the implementation of certain…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.71,0:25:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…well…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.31,0:25:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们称它们为…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…let's call them…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.52,0:25:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,削减{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…"cutbacks."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.42,0:25:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但谁能为梦想估价{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But who can put a price tag on a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.26,0:25:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们受人敬重的前主席 有一个梦想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our esteemed former chairman had a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.56,0:25:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫它做三角洲城{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He called it Delta City.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.40,0:25:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 强生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knock it off, Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.50,0:25:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 伟大的底特律市代表着一个重要的先河{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The great city of Detroit represents an important precedent, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.44,0:25:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有一个小问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one small problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.51,0:25:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,它变成了一个战区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's turning into a war zone!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.15,0:25:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个小规模反抗组织罢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a small resistance group.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.11,0:25:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会构成重大威胁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no reason to believe they pose a significant threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.35,0:25:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd consider…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.15,0:25:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,三亿五千万元的赤字 是个重大威胁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a deficit of 350 million dollars a significant threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.56,0:25:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldrt you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.76,0:25:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 费历克 - 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fleck! - Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.66,0:25:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你主管保安概念部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in charge of Security Concepts.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.10,0:25:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们耗资巨大的机械警察在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's that Robocop we spent so much money on?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.30,0:26:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方对那个装置有问题 我正在处理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police had a problem with the unit. I'm dealing with it personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.41,0:26:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.10,0:26:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,派他去建改组{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him to the Rehab Team…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.14,0:26:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也许就不用担心 一个小规模反抗组织了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and maybe we won't have to worry about a "small resistance group."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.69,0:26:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们快滚出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the hell out of here, all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.48,0:26:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们慢慢来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.08,0:26:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 费历克…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for God's sake, Fleck…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.42,0:26:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝试拉拢警方帮我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…try to get the police on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.43,0:26:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我不想有个机械人在我队中呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I don't want a robot on my team?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.87,0:26:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,保罗麦代格 你有四天时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got 4 days, McDaggett.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.07,0:26:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,若卡迪拉克区在周五凌晨 还未清场进行拆毁…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Cadillac Heights isn't cleared for demolition Friday midnight…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.77,0:26:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会被追讨贷款 OCP就会完蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…our loans will be called in. OCP will be ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.14,0:26:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有个协议的 是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made a deal, didn't we, chum.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.88,0:26:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便一提…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, by the way…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.18,0:26:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你觉得做大生意和作战的界线…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if you're just figuring out the line between big business and war…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.19,0:26:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点模糊不清…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is a little blurry…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.56,0:26:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你就是 比他们口中说得好要糟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…then you're further over the hill than they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.79,0:27:03.53,Note,0,0,0,0,,（金光世界总部）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.21,0:27:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,[日语] 但是 金光先生{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.29,0:27:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,[日语] 我们从没派过雄志去这么人口稠密的地区{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.51,0:27:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,[日语] 不要再讨论了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.67,0:27:50.08,Note,0,0,0,0,,（西区警察局）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.25,0:27:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是诱捕 我的当事人当时在那间旅馆探访朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is entrapment! My client was visiting close friends in that motel.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.32,0:27:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当事人的朋友们…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy. Your client's friends…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.59,0:28:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一支非工会摄影组和一头德国牧羊狗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…were a non-union video crew and a German shepherd.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.86,0:28:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那有偏见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's prejudicial.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.42,0:28:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个负责拘捕的警员有否要求看他们的工会证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did the arresting officer ask to see their union cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.40,0:28:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,来处理这个 听电话好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come get this crap. Will someone answer the damn phone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.13,0:28:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,西区 不 小姐 我们没有罢工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metro West. No, ma'am, we're not on strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.27,0:28:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本可以骗倒我 我会处置那班劫匪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have fooled me. I'll deal with those looters myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.07,0:28:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一支有钉的垒球棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me a baseball bat with some nails in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.52,0:28:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.69,0:28:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不大好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been better.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.29,0:28:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 你像跟一辆货车做了朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be honest, it looks like you just made friends with a Mack truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.40,0:28:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有很多…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have many…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.27,0:28:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.51,0:28:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,赖莎拉斯博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Lazarus.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.48,0:29:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发生了什么事 - 阿特兰大队昨晚打赢活塞队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want to tell me what happened? - Atlanta beat the Pistons last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.62,0:29:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很有趣 我是指英勇小子 - 是他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's cute. I meant with glory boy. - Oh, him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.36,0:29:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他受到枪击 还着了火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got shot to hell and set on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.43,0:29:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白我的意思 他违抗直接命令 为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I'm talking about. He disobeyed a direct order. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.23,0:29:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我真正的意见 - 不 说谎 编个故事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My real opinion? - No, lie. Make up a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.07,0:29:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,费历克先生…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Mr. Fleck…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.31,0:29:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…offhand…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.77,0:29:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为他抗命的唯一理由是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…l'd say the only reason he'd disobey an order is if…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.88,0:29:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不同意那个命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…he didn't agree with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.12,0:29:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.42,0:29:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他作了一个决定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made a decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.62,0:29:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的朋友有麻烦 他作出判断 警察都那样做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His friend was in trouble, he made a judgment call. Cops do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.72,0:29:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类的警察 你说「他的朋友」是什么意思 它是副机器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human cops. What do you mean, "his friend"? It's a machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.09,0:29:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.16,0:29:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果OCP只要一个机械人 为何他们派墨菲去那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if oCP just wanted a robot, why'd they put Murphy in there in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.50,0:29:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨菲已经死了 已有记录在案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murphy's dead, sweetheart, that's on record.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.13,0:29:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,费历克先生 这就是墨菲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Fleck, this is Murphy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.77,0:29:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他的面孔 大脑 小脑所留下的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's left of his face, his cerebrum, his cerebellum.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.64,0:30:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,人体组织仍然存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human tissue that's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.21,0:30:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何结合两者…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you interface human and machine…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.44,0:30:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但当人类部分作决定时又要抱怨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then complain when the human part makes a decision?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.28,0:30:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我们不但得到了墨菲多年来的训练…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So not only did we get Murphy's years of training…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.76,0:30:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,和执法技巧 还继承了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his law-enforcement skills, we also inerited…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.79,0:30:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的记忆 感觉和情绪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…his memories, his feelings, his emotional baggage?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.13,0:30:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会叫它做他的人性 但我相信你不认识那个字眼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'd call it his humanity, but I don't think you know that word.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.30,0:30:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.27,0:30:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说服我了 删除他的情感{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You talked me into it. His emotions: Get rid of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.64,0:30:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,找出它们的位置后消除它们 如果洗掉他的记忆 那真糟糕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find their location and erase them. If it wipes out his memory, too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.22,0:30:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以植入一个 微型神经障碍器…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could cut out the appropriate circuits by…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.35,0:30:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,截断有关的线路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…implanting a micro-neuro-barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.60,0:30:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,做吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.43,0:31:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我不管你有多聪明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got news for you. I don't give a shit how smart you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.54,0:31:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,OCP拥有警队 拥有他 还拥有你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}OCP owns the cops. That means they own him, and they own your cute little ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.24,0:31:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人能拥有我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody owns me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.71,0:31:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.31,0:31:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要他加入建改队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want him on the Rehab Team.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.35,0:31:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把他改为可以预测 否则你另谋高就{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means you make him predictable, or look for a new job, sweet cheeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.16,0:31:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我堕入爱河了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.24,0:31:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脑海中想着什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going through your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.22,0:31:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,（记忆搜寻：墨菲）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.83,0:32:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他的家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.06,0:32:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,可要我安装那个神经障碍器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want me to install the neuro-barrier, doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.07,0:32:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我可以做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.18,0:32:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想单独陪着他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'd like to be alone with him, if it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.53,0:32:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,（记忆搜寻：墨菲）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.87,0:32:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨菲 我以为你永远不回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex, I thought you'd never get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.35,0:32:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让那些无家可归的人动摇你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let the fact that these people are homeless sway you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.22,0:33:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是恐怖分子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're terrorists, pure and simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.16,0:33:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,画面上的都是可疑的叛军位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the screens are suspected rebel locations.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.40,0:33:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,若这些地点在你们的巡逻范围内 便去查看一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If these locations appear on your regular beat, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.57,0:33:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告任何不寻常的发现…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure you report any unusual findings…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.77,0:33:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有听到他们怎样处置墨菲吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear what they did to Murphy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.60,0:33:56.31,Note,0,0,0,0,,（重播）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.09,0:34:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨菲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murphy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.75,0:34:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,路易斯 要不要盔甲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lewis, you want your body armor?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.08,0:34:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不要 我下班了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No, I'm off duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.74,0:34:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底什么事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.22,0:34:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have family?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.21,0:34:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 有个在匹兹堡 从不打电话给我的弟弟 你知道的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I have a brother in Pittsburgh, the one who never calls. You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.09,0:34:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,机械人 你没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robo, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.40,0:34:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.33,0:34:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我墨菲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And call me Murphy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.23,0:35:55.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（热能图像）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.77,0:36:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨菲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murphy?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.78,0:36:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这座建筑物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step out of the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.37,0:36:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在原地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.87,0:36:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're police officers.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.90,0:36:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不需要你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.30,0:36:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面有一些擅闯者 别靠近那扇门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We believe there are squatters in there. Now step away from the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.23,0:36:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是平民 他们想取暖罢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're civilians. They're just trying to stay warm!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.60,0:36:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人是属于一所改造中心的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those people belong in the nearest rehabilitation center.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.45,0:36:52.78,Note,0,0,0,0,,（首要指令：1>为公众服务）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.12,0:36:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,部分是恐怖分子 走开 否则你会被控阻碍办公{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some are terrorists. Step away or you will be cited for obstructing justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.19,0:37:02.09,Note,0,0,0,0,,（首要指令：2>保护无辜者）
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.06,0:37:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再礼貌地要求了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going to ask politely next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.47,0:37:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,别靠近那扇门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step away from the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.87,0:37:08.89,Note,0,0,0,0,,（首要指令：3>执行法纪）
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.40,0:37:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你们的最后警告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your final warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.07,0:37:17.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（首要指令：4>不准违抗OCP人员）
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.09,0:37:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们犯了个错误{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are making a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.16,0:37:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 退后 否则会有麻烦 - 这样才对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Back off, or there'll be trouble. - Now you're talking, Murphy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.40,0:37:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会让步 你们开枪射我们吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not budging. If you wanna get in, you'll have to shoot through us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.74,0:37:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不觉得那有大问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have a huge problem with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.22,0:37:57.65,Note,0,0,0,0,,（4>不准违抗OCP人员）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.40,0:38:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,停火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cease fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.31,0:38:28.18,Note,0,0,0,0,,（系统损毁警报 效率72%）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.18,0:38:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,机械警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robocop.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.15,0:38:32.31,Note,0,0,0,0,,（系统损毁警报 效率69%）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.39,0:38:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.13,0:38:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.87,0:38:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,掩护我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.34,0:39:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个精锐的警察 是不是 伙伴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some tough cop I am. Huh, partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.22,0:39:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.82,0:39:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.55,0:39:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会痛太久的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't hurt long.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.29,0:39:44.86,Note,0,0,0,0,,（记录）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.86,0:39:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,替我抓他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get them for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.73,0:39:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.46,0:39:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我答应你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.77,0:39:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨菲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murphy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.25,0:40:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,警员身亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officer down.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.91,0:40:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.01,0:40:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.37,0:40:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮歌 我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nikko, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.76,0:40:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 跟我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.60,0:40:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个警察 是他们的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she crazy? He's a cop! He's one of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.34,0:40:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在是我们的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on our side now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.34,0:40:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说得对 你看到他做的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's right. You saw what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.58,0:40:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让个笨小孩替我们作决定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll let a stupid kid make our decisions?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.24,0:40:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们去作战 我们需要他帮忙 - 你说笑吗 看他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're at war. We can use his help. - Are you kidding me? Look at him!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.08,0:40:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他毁烂不堪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is totaled, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.75,0:40:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 没时间争论了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}People, come on. We don't have time for this shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.59,0:40:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说得对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.26,0:40:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.51,0:41:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,在五米范围内周围搜索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five-meter spread. Search the perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.81,0:41:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.22,0:41:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 长官 他在移动 - 不可能的 整个建筑物都被包围了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're tracking him, sir. He's moving. - Impossible. The building is surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.25,0:41:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走到地下去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.39,0:41:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,找个入口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find a manole.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.85,0:41:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有点阻碍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a little held up.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.69,0:42:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,老鼠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rats?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.97,0:42:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一两只吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.30,0:42:09.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（热能图像）
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.07,0:42:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,走过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on through.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.78,0:42:20.34,Note,0,0,0,0,,（系统损毁警报 效率25%）
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.38,0:42:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.66,0:42:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.36,0:42:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.56,0:42:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们快来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.53,0:42:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.44,0:42:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫你不要带他来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you it was a mistake to bring him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.77,0:42:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他重得要命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet he weighs a ton.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.38,0:42:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.45,0:42:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.78,0:42:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.62,0:42:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让开 - 扶着你那一边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out of the way. - Hold up your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.53,0:43:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看来不妙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He don't look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.69,0:43:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你胸口中了手榴弹也会不妙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't look so good either if you took a grenade in your chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.13,0:43:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,追踪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tracking.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.37,0:43:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 信标 - 追踪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Beacon. - Tracking?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.67,0:43:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会带领他们找到来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll lead them right to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.60,0:43:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 康斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, Coontz!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.54,0:43:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.10,0:43:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他可有在入口设下陷阱 - 可能吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did he booby-trap the 8th Street entrance? - Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.89,0:44:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还是快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better get mobilized, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.79,0:44:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那次他们几乎得手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got a little too close to home that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.26,0:44:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是不值得的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not won'th it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.13,0:44:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本不值得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not won'th this shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.50,0:44:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好深深吸一口气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better take a real deep breath right now, Coontz.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.44,0:44:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为如果你认为这样不值得…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if you don't think it's won'th it…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.11,0:44:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就死定了 明白吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…then you're nothing but excess baggage. Do you hear me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.58,0:44:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get it together, Coontz.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.12,0:44:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡迪拉克区可能不算得什么 但它是我们的家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cadillac Heights may not be much, but it's our home.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.15,0:44:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只有它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.49,0:44:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你认为我们的家园不值得 告诉我什么才值得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't think our homes is won'th it, then tell me what the hell is.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.80,0:44:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝黛叫基地行动组 请通话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Bertha to Base op. We're coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.60,0:44:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,设置一个新地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set an extra place.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.77,0:44:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会带一个朋友来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're bringing in a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.88,0:45:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有来电{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming caller.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.39,0:45:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.06,0:45:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,美人 做得好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice work, dollface.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.83,0:45:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.53,0:45:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没听到吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.23,0:45:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如看看新闻追击吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might want to turn on Media Break.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.60,0:45:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,开电视 378频道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tv on, channel 378.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.24,0:45:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,目击这次悲惨开枪事件的 是建改队指挥官保罗·麦代格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witness to the tragic shooting was Rehab Commander, Paul McDaggett.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.14,0:45:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能说 这次损失了一个良好的公仆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I can say is it's a terrible loss of a fine public servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.28,0:45:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她被自己的伙伴射死 真是难以置信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard to believe that she was gunned down by her own partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.22,0:45:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,OCP发言人证实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An OCP spokesperson has confirmed…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.32,0:45:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,机械警察已经加入了叛军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Robocop has joined the terrorist rebel forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.62,0:45:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拥有大量武器 是个危险人物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is heavily armed and should be considered extremely dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.23,0:45:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,关电视{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tv off.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.73,0:46:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你 美人儿 听着 我要你…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations, sweet cheeks. Now listen up. I want your legendary ass…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.20,0:46:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,带着你的工作证到我的办公室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and your corporate I.D. Card in my office…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.51,0:46:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会被起诉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And maybe you won't be brought up on charges.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.11,0:46:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你考虑一下你要帮哪一边吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meantime, you might want to decide whose side you're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.85,0:46:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleep tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.85,0:46:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,（通话完毕 通话时间一分三秒）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.66,0:46:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他什么 - 向建改队开枪和做地下工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He what? - Shot at Rehabs and went underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.46,0:46:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们的公关预算泡汤了 - 公司说他叛变了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There goes our P.R. Budget. - Company line is he's gone renegade.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.73,0:46:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 总管有何反应 - 你认为会怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How'd the CEO take it? - How do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.37,0:46:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说 总管很生气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Between me and you, I think the CEO's losing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.74,0:46:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看周围{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, take a look around, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.27,0:46:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里像罗马帝国倒台一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the Fall of Rome around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.48,0:46:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,岌岌可危 你明白吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Darwin time, you know what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.35,0:46:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,有用的才能生存{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Survival of the least expendable.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.65,0:46:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得旧老板吧 所有人都可以被牺牲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember the old man. Everyone's expendable.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.19,0:46:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是那么糟糕的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.36,0:46:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你听到吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.92,0:47:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.23,0:47:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,每间公司都有这个情况的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every corporation goes through this sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.30,0:47:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 发生了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.82,0:47:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.05,0:47:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿诺跳楼了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arnott just went out the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.06,0:47:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是本月的第四宗 - 胆小鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's the fourth one this month. - Chickenshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.16,0:47:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会选择吞枪自杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd eat a bullet myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.83,0:47:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没那么张扬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Less showy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.24,0:47:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跟那间混帐金光公司合作的那一刻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The writing was on the wall the minute we hopped…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.37,0:47:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,就已经心知肚明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in the sack with that shitty Kanemitsu corporation.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.08,0:47:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如我说…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I was saying…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.93,0:48:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有捉拿机械警察的拘捕令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we have a warrant out for Robocop's arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.56,0:48:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们把他铲除 我们认为那些擅闯者…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can eliminate him, then we'll find that the squatters are more…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.26,0:48:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就更容易被说服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…let's say, easily persuaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.11,0:48:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 费历克 - 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fleck! - Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.25,0:48:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,老板 抱歉打扰你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry for the intrusion, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.08,0:48:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,保安概念部有什么可以做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything Security Concepts can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.69,0:48:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,保安概念部可以去死 你被开除了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security Concepts can kiss my freckled butt. You're fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.36,0:48:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到吧 你被开除了 滚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard me! You're fired. Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.77,0:48:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,三天后就有大灾难{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three days until disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.11,0:48:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎样向股东们解释{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell will I tell my shareholders?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.81,0:48:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,增加建改队人手如何{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about more Rehabs, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.81,0:49:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以从警察部招募的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could recruit them out of the Police Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.28,0:49:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们比雇佣兵更便宜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be cheaper than mercenaries…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.52,0:49:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以利用西区警察局作试点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and we could use the Metro West facility as a staging area.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.59,0:49:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他们象征式的加薪以作鼓励{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give them a nominal raise for an incentive.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.36,0:49:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,强生 你是个好人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a good man, Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.56,0:49:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我提升你做副总裁是有原因的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew there was a reason I made you a vice president.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.56,0:49:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,过奖 老板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.80,0:49:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.07,0:49:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,（暴虐的资本主义蠢猪）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.24,0:50:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heads up!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.15,0:50:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我们要迟到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go. We're gonna be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.30,0:51:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.50,0:51:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能否修理他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you fix him?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.67,0:51:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是修理汽车活门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a valve job on a Chevy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.38,0:51:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没修理过机械警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never worked on a damn Robocop before.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.35,0:51:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以修理机身 但是… - 听着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can do the body work, but… - Look…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.22,0:51:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要多保卫着卡迪拉克区三天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we gotta hang on to the Heights for three more days.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.32,0:51:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他能否支持到那时 - 你有没有听我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He can hold out till then, can't he? - Are you listening to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.66,0:51:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他损毁严重 我们也没有仪器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's messed up. We don't have the equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.56,0:51:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell does?!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.76,0:51:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,赖莎拉斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lazarus.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.40,0:51:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find doctor…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.84,0:51:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,赖莎拉斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lazarus.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.54,0:52:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.48,0:52:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是机械警察的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm friends with Robocop.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.22,0:52:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不在这里 抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's not here. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.65,0:52:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.59,0:52:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,坦白说 我不知道该相信什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To tell you the truth, I don't know what to believe anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.73,0:52:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要我带个话给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had a message for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.07,0:52:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说感谢你没有洗掉他的记忆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said to thank you for not taking his memories away.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.59,0:53:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.23,0:53:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕你来迟一步了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afraid you're a little late, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.63,0:53:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定是金光的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be one of Kanemitsu's boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.41,0:53:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很钦佩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.57,0:53:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trouble is…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.35,0:53:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的老板…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…your boss…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.15,0:53:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拥有OCP{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…he kind of owns oCP.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.58,0:53:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,而OCP是我们的死对头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And oCP's kind of on our shitlist with a bullet!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.76,0:54:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想知道叛军在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you want to know where the rebels are?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.87,0:54:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以叫你的老板去死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can tell your bosses to kiss my ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.14,0:55:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一辆车正在驶近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A vehicle is approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.53,0:56:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨菲 你好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing, Murphy?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.67,0:56:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不大好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been better.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.60,0:56:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给我一个状态扫描 - 生物体没有受损{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give me a status scan. - Organics intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.14,0:56:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,系统效率23%{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Systems efficiency: 23 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.15,0:56:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,心脏直接受撞击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like a direct hit to the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.65,0:56:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要重新调校充气系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to recalibrate the pneumatic system.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.28,0:56:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会不会死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he gonna die?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.86,0:56:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮到它就不会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if I can help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.59,0:56:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,接到发电机吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get everything hooked up to the generator.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.69,0:56:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有工作要做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.23,0:56:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,听这 我要暂时关掉你的能源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to unplug you for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.50,0:56:35.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（系统损毁警报 效率12%）
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.60,0:56:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心 不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, everything's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.44,0:56:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.18,0:56:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到你要的那个心脏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got that heart you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.75,0:56:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说要日产 那是金光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said a Nissan. That's a Kanemitsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.39,0:56:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,泽克 我们要那支密封胶 泽克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zack, we need that sealant! Zack!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.66,0:56:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛莉… 看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marie! Marie! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.86,0:56:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.69,0:57:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿那块胸部金属板来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring me that chest plate over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.23,0:57:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wait, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.60,0:57:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会没事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are gonna be so cherry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.77,0:57:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫连奴 小心那个…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moreno, watch out for the…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.61,0:57:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.55,0:57:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道那东西在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know that thing was there!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.55,0:57:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别向我大叫 - 那么 不要那样做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't yell at me! - Well, don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.77,0:57:26.81,Note,0,0,0,0,,（首要指令）
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.81,0:57:28.31,Note,0,0,0,0,,（1>为公众服务）
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.31,0:57:29.36,Note,0,0,0,0,,（2>保护无辜者）
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.36,0:57:30.23,Note,0,0,0,0,,（3>执行法纪）
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.23,0:57:32.57,Note,0,0,0,0,,（4>不准违抗OCP人员）
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.03,0:57:34.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（4>已被删除）
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.73,0:57:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨菲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murphy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.34,0:57:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.31,0:57:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨菲 我以为你永远不会回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex, I thought you'd never get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.37,0:58:21.31,Note,0,0,0,0,,（指令记忆设定 系统状态良好）
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.31,0:58:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨菲 欢迎你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome home, Murphy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.27,0:58:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我睡不着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.71,0:58:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.51,0:58:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的效率现在是93%{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My efficiency rate is 93 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.81,0:59:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,90以上都是正常{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything above 90 is considered normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.22,0:59:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到玛莉叫你做墨菲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard Marie call you Murphy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.22,0:59:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你的真名字吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that your real name?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.69,0:59:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前是的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.69,0:59:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…before…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.43,0:59:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before what?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.81,0:59:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.58,0:59:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在复原了 你会留下来吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that you're better, will you stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.38,0:59:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会不会帮我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.65,0:59:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道贝黛说什么吧 若我们抵抗建改队多两天…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what Bertha says. If we hold back the Rehabs for two more days…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.29,0:59:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就不能逼我们搬迁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…they can't make us move.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.29,0:59:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就要释放我爸妈 我们会一家团聚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they'll have to let my parents go. We'll all be together like family again.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.23,0:59:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的爸妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your parents?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.48,1:00:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,（身亡）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.25,1:00:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,（身亡）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.72,1:00:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨菲 你没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murphy? You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.73,1:00:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想念他们吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your parents, you miss them?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.23,1:00:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,想念{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.34,1:00:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.87,1:00:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记着他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you remember them.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.34,1:00:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.54,1:00:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你记着他们…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if you remember them…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.58,1:00:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就没有真正离开过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…they're never really gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.87,1:01:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨菲…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Murphy…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.74,1:01:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴你新的心脏有效{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…l'm glad your new heart works.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.85,1:01:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到一些声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard voices.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.02,1:01:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她该上床睡了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She should be in bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.83,1:01:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可以再留…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you leave her…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.47,1:01:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一会儿吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…just a moment?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.24,1:01:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.74,1:02:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要付钱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta pay for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.10,1:02:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你聋的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, deaf?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.93,1:02:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,混…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.76,1:02:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是那么说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what we said.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.67,1:02:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是说要那样做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not what we said we were gonna do!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.67,1:02:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说要迁移那些武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bertha, you said to relocate the weapons…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.49,1:02:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这东西要放在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but where do you want this thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.44,1:02:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.89,1:02:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么找到这个的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get this?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.10,1:02:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,从警方那里偷来的 为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stole it from the police depot. Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.89,1:03:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看似是F27拆下来的排气系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This looks like the exhaust system from an F-27.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.09,1:03:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是机械警察的飞行装置蓝本{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It's the prototype for Robo's flight pack.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.72,1:03:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们测试它前 经费就耗尽了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The funding ran out before we got a chance to test it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.11,1:03:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道这么多 - 是我设计的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you know so much about it? - I designed it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.10,1:03:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们取胜的机会增大了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, looks like the odds on the home team just went up.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.72,1:03:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会听从你的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I've done is programmed the command system…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.52,1:03:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,硬体指挥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to take its cues from your hard drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.79,1:03:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还把它改装成一个辅助驱进器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've also rigged it to work as an auxiliary power unit.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.06,1:03:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你的动力下降…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you ever have a power drain like yesterday…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.05,1:03:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要接上飞行装置再充电就行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…just interface with the flight pack and recharge whether you fly or not.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.84,1:03:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到那些电阻器吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nikko, see those resistors over there?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.51,1:03:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦你给我 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get them for me, will you?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.12,1:03:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦你给我 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get them for me, will you?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.65,1:04:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,替我抓他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get them for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.61,1:04:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.67,1:04:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,替我抓他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get them for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.61,1:04:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.21,1:04:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.14,1:04:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.48,1:04:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, where you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.22,1:04:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,做未做完的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfinished business.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.46,1:04:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要紧 他会回来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. He'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.46,1:04:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也需要我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs us too.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.33,1:04:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要去哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's he going?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.33,1:04:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,履行承诺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To keep a promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.07,1:04:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有个机械警察 有没有外星人警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a Robocop. You got an alien cop?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.60,1:05:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有没有幽灵警察 - 我没有时间…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got a ghost cop? - I don't have time for…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.34,1:05:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有吸血殭尸警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a vampire cop?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.35,1:05:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 墨菲 - 晚安 瑞德警官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Murphy. - Good evening, Sergeant Reed.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.68,1:05:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可知道有拘捕令要逮捕你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know there's a warrant out for your arrest?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.72,1:05:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.06,1:05:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问问罢了 有什么可以效劳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just checking. What can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.79,1:05:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,请指示我建改队试点的位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please direct me to the Rehab Staging Area.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.16,1:05:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在走廊前端 你会找到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's down the hall. You can't miss it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.73,1:05:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.67,1:05:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能要通知消防队了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may want to call the fire department.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.35,1:05:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有没有火 - 有的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got a light? - Sure, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.32,1:05:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来吧 混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me, scum.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.79,1:06:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.56,1:06:36.36,Note,0,0,0,0,,（盘问状态）
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.34,1:06:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,保罗·麦代格在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's McDaggett?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.82,1:06:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里不像一间警察局{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That does not look like a police station.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.62,1:07:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我不是在警察局里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're damn right I'm not at the station.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.33,1:07:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是我的探子警告我 我现在已经死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If my spy hadrt warned me, I'd be dead now.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.16,1:07:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你那个该死的忍者 会对付机械警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought your damn ninja was supposed to take care of Robocop.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.80,1:07:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,说好了 我清理那一区 他就不让那个机械人找我麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the deal. I clear the area, he keeps the robot off my back.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.84,1:07:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有我调派给你的装置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have the device I sent you?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.31,1:07:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不用那个 也不会用 放松点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It hasn't come to that yet. And it won't. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.52,1:07:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我不清楚你的做法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is difficult for me to continue our business relationship…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.12,1:07:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很难合作下去的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when I don't know your methods.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.62,1:07:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必知道我的做法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need to know my methods.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.29,1:07:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会清理那一区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I'll clear the area and I'll clear it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.63,1:07:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别让那个机械警察烦我就是了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get the robot cop off my back.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.78,1:07:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你会付厚酬 去得到叛军总部的地点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand you're willing to pay good money to know where the rebel base is.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.59,1:08:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.69,1:08:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,报酬很丰厚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the money's good…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.69,1:08:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果情报准确的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if the tip's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.77,1:08:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次的情报救了你一命 是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last tip saved your ass, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.49,1:08:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.12,1:08:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不喜欢穿制服的男人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't like men in uniform?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.79,1:08:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸刚失业 我需要一点钱罢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad lost his job. I just need some money.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.83,1:08:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们有钱 - 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We've got lots of money, honey. - Don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.76,1:08:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要 - 她说不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - She said, "No."
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.77,1:08:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听觉有问题吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you have a hearing problem?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.14,1:08:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 回家吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go home, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.71,1:09:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你违反了宵禁条例{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are in violation of curfew.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.23,1:09:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,保罗·麦代格在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's McDaggett?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.06,1:09:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,212号房{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Room 212.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.57,1:09:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.73,1:09:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你买了保险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you are insured.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.27,1:09:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,电梯门坏的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elevator door sticks!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.43,1:09:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.14,1:10:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,路易斯警员托我带个话给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a message from officer Lewis.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.79,1:10:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.56,1:10:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,开车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drive!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.43,1:10:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫你开车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, drive, goddamn it, drive!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.41,1:10:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的时间 金钱 我不会再说了 明白吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My time, my money. I told you and won't tell you again, understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.55,1:10:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要征用你的汽车作警方用途{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must commandeer your vehicle for police use.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.18,1:10:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么问题 混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your problem, sucker?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.15,1:10:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是指… 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, officer.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.69,1:12:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,掩护我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.21,1:12:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.12,1:13:07.11,Note,0,0,0,0,,（警告：儿童在玩耍）
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.47,1:13:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.39,1:13:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,机械警察去了哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell is Robocop?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.39,1:13:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以开车听一下哪里有爆炸声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could drive around and listen for explosions.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.23,1:13:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你做的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you doing that?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.40,1:13:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我厌倦了焊接电线 所以放进一个脉冲流速解码器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got tired of splicing wires, so I put in a pulse tach decoder.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.77,1:13:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 摇测的 - 不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Telemetric? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.77,1:13:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真聪明 - 你才聪明 我算得上什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Smart ass. - I know you are, but what am I?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.74,1:14:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我试试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, let me try.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.19,1:14:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吓我们一跳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.46,1:14:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会派遣一支侦察队出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe I will go and send out a recon team.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.36,1:14:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个更好的方法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a better idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.87,1:14:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如我们都坐下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we just all have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.27,1:14:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,和放松{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And relax.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.07,1:14:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,几分钟内就会结束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll all be over in a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.71,1:14:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.31,1:14:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心说话 有孩子在场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch the language, there's children present.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.65,1:14:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下它 康斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it, Coontz.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.62,1:14:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会重复说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going to ask twice.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.83,1:14:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么意思「几分钟内就结束」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "it'll all be over in a few minutes"?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.17,1:14:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快带孩子们离开 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the kids out of here! Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.68,1:15:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝黛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bertha!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.16,1:15:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.69,1:15:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要去救她 - 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got to get her. - Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.43,1:15:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.35,1:15:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.39,1:15:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Get in! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.86,1:15:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.47,1:16:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, now go!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.24,1:16:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走 - 不 又再发生了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go on! - No, it's happening again!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.44,1:16:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他们把你带走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let them take you away.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.65,1:16:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫你走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, go! Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.50,1:16:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.27,1:16:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.67,1:16:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她去总部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her to headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.61,1:16:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的手下不会在你身上留下痕迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise my men won't leave a mark on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.18,1:16:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 我们的朋友康斯又怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir. What about our friend Coontz?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.52,1:16:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我们让他活着就要付钱给他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we'd let him live, we'd have to have paid him.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.17,1:17:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说会损失数十万元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're talking about hundreds of thousands of dollars in damage.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.64,1:17:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 墨菲对财物不留情的 - 很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Murphy can be rough on properties. - Yeah. Well…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.84,1:17:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,每分每毫的损失 都由你的薪水中扣除{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…every cent of it will be coming out of your salaries.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.58,1:17:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你们制造他的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! You built him!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.69,1:17:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要进占卡迪拉克区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're taking Cadillac Heights.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.06,1:17:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你50个手下 一小时后全副武装候命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll need 50 of your men armed and in full body armor in one hour. Johnson…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.46,1:17:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉总裁 拆卸人员明早六点可以进入{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…tell the CEO the demolition crews will have access at 06:00 hours tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.33,1:17:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不做那类工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we don't do that kind of work.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.07,1:17:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个直接命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a direct order, sergeant.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.44,1:17:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,把市民逐出家园 不是警察的工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Driving people out of their homes is no work for a cop!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.11,1:17:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,警官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, sergeant.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.64,1:17:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,在警队工作15年是一项投资{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifteen years on the force is quite an investment.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.48,1:17:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的工作 你的退休金{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your job, your pension.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.55,1:18:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心那些擅闯者了 想想你的家人吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe instead of worrying about these squatters, think about your own family.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.29,1:18:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.50,1:18:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在想我要回家面对他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking I have to go home and face them.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.68,1:18:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不能这样做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.36,1:18:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是OCP的雇员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are employees of oCP!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.33,1:18:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,记着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now remember that.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.43,1:18:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在危害自己的退休福利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're jeopardizing your retirement benefits!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.41,1:19:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,截住那个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop that man.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.25,1:19:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你的朋友们可想赚点钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would you and your friends like to make some money?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.70,1:19:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是… - 强尼…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's… - Johnny…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.80,1:19:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 建改队 - 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rehab! - Hurray!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.18,1:19:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,强尼建改队人像 配件和服饰个别发售{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny Rehab action figures, parts and accessories all sold separately.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.19,1:19:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,在被认为是机械警察的 最新暴行中…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three nuns and five clergy are dead…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.56,1:19:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有三名修女和五名神职人员丧生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in what is believed to be the latest atrocity by the killer cyborg, Robocop.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.20,1:19:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,OCP宣称该名前度警员…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The OCP claim the former police unit…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.43,1:19:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在底特律市旧城的卡迪拉克区…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is responsible for a spree of terrorism…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.47,1:20:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,引发一轮恐怖活动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in the Cadillac Heights section of Old Detroit.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.21,1:20:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我不能读这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I can't even read this.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.34,1:20:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直胡说八道 你相信它吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is bullshit! Are you buying this?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.88,1:20:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开玩笑嘛 机械战警{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding me? Robocop?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.85,1:20:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,（临时故障）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.18,1:21:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marie.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.69,1:21:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,混帐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lousy sons of bitches!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.20,1:21:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 神经病混蛋 - 没有人会听的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OCP bastards! - Nobody is listening to you, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.74,1:21:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们各就各位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are in position.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.37,1:21:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是大棍 准备就绪 带齐武器进入攻击区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Big Stick. You have a green. Arm and proceed to strike zone.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.07,1:21:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有队伍 准备就绪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All teams, we have a green.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.48,1:21:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有队伍 准备就绪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All teams, we have a green.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.15,1:21:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.81,1:22:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在怎么办 - 怎么办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So what now? - What now?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.21,1:22:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 完蛋了 闭嘴吧 - 贝黛的计划又如何{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Game's over, Moreno. Just shut up. - What about Bertha's plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.35,1:22:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 贝黛已经死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it! Bertha's dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.69,1:22:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.28,1:22:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 大约45分钟后…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Folks, in about 45 minutes…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.71,1:22:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,建改队就会来对付你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the Rehabs are coming to blow you out of your neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.25,1:23:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,带你们的孩子…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to take your kids…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.85,1:23:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,和任何不能作战的人到地下室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and anybody who shouldn't be fighting to the basement!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.06,1:23:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,其余的人就受底特律警察部委派{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest of you are hereby deputized by the Detroit Police Department.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.16,1:23:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候给他们看看警察的厉害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to show how real cops kick ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.31,1:24:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,底特律警察 出示你的身分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detroit Police! Identify yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.78,1:24:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你因为袭警被拘捕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are under arrest for assaulting an officer.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.46,1:24:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有破坏警方财物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And destruction of police property.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.74,1:25:07.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（动力能量低 需要下载能量）
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.31,1:25:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,肃静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.54,1:25:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,肃静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.61,1:25:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开火 直到有绝对需要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire until absolutely necessary.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.27,1:27:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥官…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.47,1:27:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 底特律警方在外面 他们在反抗我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Detroit Police are out there, sir. They're fighting against us.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.88,1:27:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又如何 我们要依期行事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So? We have a schedule to keep.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.88,1:27:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不可向警察开火 你太过分了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't fire on police officers! You're out of line, McDaggett.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.75,1:27:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是指挥 由我做主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in charge here. I'm pulling the plug.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.59,1:27:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.09,1:27:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打仗打疯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you gone war-wacky?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.16,1:27:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫你坐下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.07,1:27:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.24,1:27:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎样离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are we getting out of here anyway?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.11,1:27:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎样… 算了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you get… Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.35,1:27:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面有没有传讯碟形天线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a transmission dish outside?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.25,1:28:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 我还看到新闻追击 那个傢伙挖鼻孔呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and I was just watching the Media Break guy pick his nose.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.82,1:28:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有电脑吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have your computer with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.46,1:28:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,底特律的市民…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}People of Detroit…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.20,1:28:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是非法广播 它随时会被截断{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…this is an illegal broadcast. It may be cut off at any time.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.85,1:28:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以听我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.70,1:28:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,OCP在欺骗你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}OCP is lying to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.68,1:28:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为了大生意而杀害生命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're destroying people's lives for big business.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.81,1:28:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,在电视上的那些建改队…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those Rehabs you see on TV…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.65,1:28:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是OCP聘用的雇佣兵 要把市民逐出家园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…they're mercenaries hired by OCP to throw people out of their homes.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.83,1:28:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to believe me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.46,1:28:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我代表本市所有无家可归者 失业者…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm speaking for all the homeless and jobless citizens of this city…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.56,1:28:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,和每个受资产主义混蛋管治的城市发言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and every city like it run by heartless capitalist scumbags…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.84,1:29:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,OCP不关心市民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}OCP doesn't care about people. OCP cares about…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.75,1:29:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,反抗吧 否则你的邻居就是下一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your neighborhood is next unless you fight back now.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.12,1:29:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了 OCP就是敌人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time's running out. OCP's the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.40,1:29:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间不多了 OCP就是敌人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I repeat. Time is running out. OCP is the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.77,1:29:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,无辜市民正在死去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help us. Innocent people are dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.07,1:29:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给我子弹 - 给我子弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- More ammo! - More ammo!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.76,1:30:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,泽克中枪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zack's hit!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.83,1:30:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会赢 是不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're winning, aren't they, sergeant?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.84,1:30:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in the name…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.66,1:30:59.41,Note,0,0,0,0,,（瞄准中 智能炸弹已接合）
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.14,1:31:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.49,1:31:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 你们这班混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Splatter that, you sons of bitches!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.08,1:31:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,大棍 请通话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in, Big Stick.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.62,1:31:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 机械警察先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Mr. Robocop.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.83,1:32:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,别靠近那扇门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.71,1:32:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think it over.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.25,1:32:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 股价跌至零了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, Johnson, our stock has dropped to nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.55,1:32:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们完蛋了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're ruined.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.64,1:32:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,警员 有什么可以效劳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How may I help you, officer?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.24,1:32:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,拒捕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By resisting arrest.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.21,1:32:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,休想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't count on it, chum.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.51,1:32:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,控罪是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, what's the charge?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.58,1:32:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,谋杀安妮·路易斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The murder of Anne Lewis.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.18,1:33:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管死活 你也要束手就擒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead or alive, you're coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.88,1:33:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以要了OCP 它是你的了 再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}McDaggett, you can have OCP. It's all yours. Sayonara.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.18,1:33:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where're you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.85,1:33:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会错过好戏的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna miss all the fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.74,1:34:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别逞强了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No flashy bravery, tin man.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.77,1:34:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则那两个可人儿会说再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the two cuties say, "Bye-bye."
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.10,1:34:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.92,1:34:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.65,1:34:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,制止他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop them! Stop them!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.83,1:34:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,蠢才{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid fools!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.11,1:34:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可知道你做了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you know what you've done to us?!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.77,1:35:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些机械人装有 热能故障安全设备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those androids are programmed with a thermal fail-safe device.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.67,1:35:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是指自动毁灭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean to self-destruct?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.64,1:35:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,在15秒内 所有二十码内的东西…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 15 seconds, everything within 20 yards…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.45,1:35:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会粉碎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of where we're standing will be atomized.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.04,1:35:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们死定了 笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're dead, you stupid slag.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.69,1:35:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,休想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't count on it, chum.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.43,1:35:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.82,1:35:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 算了 - 让我帮你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Let me give you a hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.69,1:36:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,金光先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kanemitsu-san…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.36,1:36:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白情况很糟糕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I realize that it looks bad…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.49,1:36:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能我们的计划野心过大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but maybe our plans were over-ambitious.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.53,1:36:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再合作较小规模的吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's start a skoshy bit smaller.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.26,1:36:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们美化这地区 兴建商场…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's gentrify this neighborhood. Build strip malls.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.20,1:36:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,快餐连锁店 大量娱乐设施 你认为怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fast-food chains. Lots of popular entertainment. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.18,1:36:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他说什么 - 你被开除了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did he say? - You're fired.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.48,1:37:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to hand it to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.68,1:37:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们叫你做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do they call you?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.52,1:37:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨菲 是不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murphy, is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.66,1:37:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友们叫我墨菲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friends call me Murphy.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.20,1:37:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就叫我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call me…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.91,1:37:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,机械警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Robocop.
